#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:2
msgid "Migration Plans"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:4
msgid ""
"Migration Plans are created and managed from :menuselection:`Tools --> "
"Migrations`. Plans orchestrate the migration of one or more VMs from "
"VMware vCenter to an HVM Cluster."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:6
msgid ""
"Plans are created in a **Pending** state and require an explicit action "
"to begin execution. This allows plans to be prepared in advance and run "
"during scheduled maintenance windows. Completed plans remain on the list "
"page for review and may be deleted when no longer needed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:9
msgid "Creating a Migration Plan"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:11
msgid ""
"From the Migrations list page (:menuselection:`Tools --> Migrations`), "
"click :guilabel:`+ ADD` to start a new plan."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:13
msgid "A list of all currently-created Migrations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:13
msgid ".. image:: /images/migrations/migrations_list.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:16
msgid "**Step 1: Setup**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:18
msgid "Configure the basic plan parameters:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:20
msgid ""
"**NAME** — A descriptive name for the migration (e.g., \"Production Web "
"Servers - Wave 1\")"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:21
msgid "**SOURCE** — The source VMware vCenter Cloud integration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:22
msgid "**TARGET** — The destination Cloud containing the HVM Cluster"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:23
msgid "**RESOURCE POOL** — The HVM Cluster to receive the migrated VMs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:24
msgid "**GROUP** — The Group which will own the migrated VMs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:26 ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:38
#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:53
msgid "Click :guilabel:`NEXT` when finished."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:28
msgid "The SETUP tab of the CREATE MIGRATION PLAN modal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:28
msgid ".. image:: /images/migrations/migration_plan_setup.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:31
msgid "**Step 2: Select VMs**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:33
msgid ""
"Choose VMs from the source VMware Cloud to include in this migration "
"plan. Selected VMs appear in a list at the bottom of the modal. You may "
"select as many VMs as needed — all selected VMs will be migrated in "
"parallel when the plan is executed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:35
msgid "Selecting source VMs to migrate from the source VMware Cloud."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:35
msgid ".. image:: /images/migrations/migration_select_vms.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:40
msgid "**Step 3: Resource Mapping**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:42
msgid "Map source resources to destination resources:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:44
msgid ""
"**Networks** — For each source network detected on the selected VMs, "
"choose the corresponding destination network on the HVM Cluster"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:45
msgid ""
"**Datastores** — For each source datastore, choose the destination "
"storage location"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:46
msgid ""
"**Credentials** — Optionally provide existing Linux or Windows "
"credentials for guest access during preparation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:47
msgid ""
"**Skip Prechecks** — Toggle to skip the precheck phase (not recommended "
"for first-time migrations)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:48
msgid ""
"**Skip Guest Tools** — Toggle to skip guest tools installation (only if "
"tools are already installed)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:50
msgid "Mapping source networks and storage to destination networks and storage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:50
msgid ".. image:: /images/migrations/migration_resource_mapping.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:55
msgid "**Step 4: Review**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:57
msgid ""
"Review all selections. Return to any previous tab to make adjustments. "
"Click :guilabel:`COMPLETE` to save the plan."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:60
msgid "Running a Migration Plan"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:62
msgid ""
"After creation, the plan is in **Pending** state on the Migrations list "
"page. All configuration details are displayed on the plan detail page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:64
msgid "To execute the migration, click :guilabel:`RUN`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:66
msgid "The migration detail page showing a migration in a pending state."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:66
msgid ".. image:: /images/migrations/migration_detail_pending.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:69
msgid "Important"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:71
msgid ""
"Running a migration will **power down source VMs** during the transfer "
"phase. Plan accordingly for service disruption on source workloads."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:74
msgid "Monitoring Progress"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:76
msgid "Once running, the plan detail page provides real-time status:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:78
msgid ""
"**Summary view** — Shows overall plan status and per-VM progress through "
"migration phases (Precheck → Prepare → Create → Transfer → Reconfigure → "
"Finalize)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:79
msgid "**History tab** — Detailed log of all actions taken during the migration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:80
msgid ""
"**Destination tab** — Details on VMs that have been successfully migrated"
" to the HVM Cluster"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:82
msgid ""
"Transfer times depend on disk sizes, network bandwidth between HVM hosts "
"and ESXi, and target storage I/O performance. The system allows up to 48 "
"hours for individual VM transfers to complete."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:84
msgid "Tip"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:86
msgid ""
"During the Transfer phase, you can monitor the **OVF Export** task in "
"vCenter for real-time progress on the actual disk transfer and "
"conversion. This reflects the true data movement from ESXi to the target "
"HVM host."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:89
msgid "Post-Migration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:91
msgid "After a successful migration:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:93
msgid ""
"Migrated VMs are running on the HVM Cluster and managed as standard "
"instances"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:94
msgid ""
"Source VMs remain powered off on VMware (they are not deleted "
"automatically)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:95
msgid ""
"Network configuration (including static IPs) is preserved on the "
"destination"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:96
msgid "MAC addresses may be preserved depending on plan configuration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/migrations/plans.rst:98
msgid ""
"Failed VMs can be retried individually from the plan detail page. Plans "
"that have fully completed can be kept for audit purposes or deleted."
msgstr ""

